     "text": "⚔️ Lucia stood down the Big Big and kept walking — 12 rounds, bloodied but breathing. It's still out there, somewhere."
    },
    {
     "day": 117,
     "text": "⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."
    },
    {
     "day": 118,
     "text": "◈ OVERTIME ×2 — wave 4–5 monsters return as RERUNS (+50% HP, +24% damage, +1 to every pack). Raids come sooner. The table docks your standing −8. Take your seat from Haven to stop the clock."
    },
    {
     "day": 118,
     "text": "🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~1540 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"
