     "text": "⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."
    },
    {
     "day": 121,
     "text": "Another face surfaces — someone you brought, or someone who brought you. ‘You didn’t think we’d come alone?’ The dead gather. (Allied monsters +4 damage, 2 turns.)"
    },
    {
     "day": 121,
     "text": "📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Quinn Murphy is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
    },
    {
     "day": 121,
     "text": "🕯️ Quinn is dead — and the dead hold no treaties. Every link Haven has shakes."
    },
    {
     "day": 121,
     "text": "With Haven grieving, Thornfield installs their own speaker at the table. Tribute rises to 25,313 kcal/week. Grief is leverage, and they know it. The link holds — it was never with one person."
    },
    {
     "day": 121,
     "text": "🕯️ Quinn Murphy is dead — combat. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging."
    },
    {
     "day": 121,
     "text": "You see smoke on the horizon. The Bloodied — 5 people, 121 days in. fishing folk, by the look of it. They know 15 plants — 13 new to you. They look lean — hungry, even. Food would talk here. They've been here the whole time."
    },
    {
